# 6. System Responsibilities

The discovery platform owns:

- Discovery session lifecycle
- Local-network permission readiness
- Network-path awareness
- Aggregating results from discovery providers
- Candidate normalization
- Duplicate candidate merging
- Session timeout handling
- Cancellation
- Progress reporting
- Manual entry routing
- Diagnostics metadata
- Delegation to plugin-specific verification

The discovery platform does not own:

- Vendor pairing credentials
- Device command execution
- Device state synchronization after onboarding
- Plugin-specific authentication
- Scene execution
- Automation execution
- Long-term device capability logic

Those responsibilities belong to the relevant plugin and platform services.

