# 11. Verification Model

Each plugin may expose a discovery provider and verifier.

```swift
protocol AuraDiscoveryProvider: Sendable {
    var pluginID: PluginIdentifier { get }

    func discoveryRequests(
        for context: DiscoveryContext
    ) -> [DiscoveryRequest]

    func verify(
        candidate: DiscoveryCandidate,
        context: DiscoveryContext
    ) async -> VerificationResult
}
```

Verification result:

```swift
enum VerificationResult: Sendable {
    case verified(VerifiedDeviceCandidate)
    case notSupported
    case requiresPairing(VerifiedDeviceCandidate)
    case temporarilyUnavailable(DiscoveryIssue)
    case failed(DiscoveryIssue)
}
```

A candidate may be checked by more than one plugin when the discovery source does not provide a reliable plugin hint.

The coordinator should minimize unnecessary verification requests by using service types, headers and stable identifier formats.

