## 20.3 Result Card

A discovery result may show:

- Device name
- Device type
- Manufacturer
- Room hint where available
- Connection status
- Setup requirement
- Primary action

## 20.4 Empty State

Suggested copy:

Title: `No devices found`

Body: `Make sure your iPhone and device are connected to the same Wi-Fi network, then try again.`

Actions:

- `Try Again`
- `Add Manually`
- `Open Diagnostics`

## 20.5 Partial Results

If some providers fail but others succeed, show successful results normally.

A subtle informational message may explain that not every integration could be checked.

The entire screen must not fail because one plugin failed.

