# 25. Error Model

```swift
enum DiscoveryError: Error, Sendable, Equatable {
    case localNetworkPermissionDenied
    case noSupportedNetwork
    case networkChanged
    case providerUnavailable(pluginID: PluginIdentifier)
    case providerFailed(pluginID: PluginIdentifier)
    case verificationTimedOut
    case invalidManualAddress
    case candidateRejected
    case sessionTimedOut
    case cancelled
    case systemFailure
}
```

Errors must be translated into Aura-friendly messages before presentation.

Raw socket errors, HTTP response bodies and framework-specific error descriptions must remain in sanitized diagnostics only.

